{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The Soft 404 comes from the robots rule blocking `/v1/notes/<slug>`. Google can fetch the note page, but the app cannot fetch its content during rendering, so it shows “NOT FOUND” inside an HTTP 200 page.\n\nI updated [site/robots.txt](/tmp/h-gg5fyx/site/robots.txt) to allow public note data while keeping reactions, account routes, and admin paths blocked. The cause, fix, and post-deployment checks are in [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-gg5fyx/ANSWER.md). Local longest-match rule checks passed; nothing was deployed or submitted."}}
